		"Find a &cBlaze&r (a Nether fortress blaze spawner is ideal) and use the Empty Blaze Burner"
		"on it to capture it."
		""
		"Feed it fuel (coal, logs) and it heats a Basin above it: &6Heated&r."
	]
	"quest.3BD47489393A7320.title": "Catch a Blaze"
